---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About the Project"
	description="Project overview for Week 5"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		This project is focused on building a clear, professional digital presence for a Week 5 academic
		deliverable. The goal is to combine strong project planning with a polished presentation so the
		work is easy to explain, easy to follow, and ready to present.
	</p>

	<p>
		The core objective is not just to create a website, but to organize the work into a coherent story:
		what the project is, why it matters, what was completed, which tools were used, and what the next
		steps look like. By structuring the work this way, it becomes easier to show progress and communicate
		technical decisions clearly.
	</p>

	<p>
		The site uses Astro as the main framework, giving the project a modern structure with fast page
		generation and a clean content-first workflow. It also demonstrates how a project can evolve from a
		starter template into a finished presentation-ready digital portfolio.
	</p>

	<p>
		This phase highlights the importance of consistency, organization, and stakeholder communication.
		On a practical level, it means keeping the project readable, documenting milestones, and ensuring
		that design choices support the message rather than distract from it.
	</p>

	<p>
		The Week 5 milestone is about turning technical effort into a strong narrative. The end result is a
		project that is not only functional, but also clearly demonstrates planning, execution, and forward
		momentum.
	</p>
</Layout>
